@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
title GNOME Window Control: placement ownership
actor "User / session manager" as user
component "Python CLI + client\nselectors and target intent" as cli
interface "Session D-Bus\nGnomeWinCtl1" as bus
package "GNOME Shell extension" {
  component "Request registry\ntokens, cancellation, bounded history" as requests
  component "Window placement\napply and verify" as placement
  component "Monitor policy\nphysical display anchors" as policy
}
component "Mutter / GNOME Shell\nwindows, workspaces, monitors" as shell
user --> cli
cli --> bus : inspect / place / expect / query
bus --> requests
requests --> placement : exact matched window + intent
placement --> shell : compositor operations
shell --> placement : geometry / mapping events
placement --> requests : deferred / verified / failed
shell --> policy : lock / topology / user movement
policy --> placement : bounded recovery
note bottom of requests
Accepted is not verified.
Inactive workspace placement may wait.
Window IDs last only for this Shell session.
end note
@enduml
